==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|elster}}, {{m|gmh|alster}}, {{m|gmh|agelster}}, from {{inh|de|goh|agalstra}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*agastrijā|t=magpie}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʔɛlstɐ/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Elster.OGG|audio}}
